{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05这类短停留段落，未标记“到时出现”的感受词仍然过密，纵向交替扫读不如X的左右分栏利落，容易顾不上听音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段关键心理变化，能让观众迅速抓住人物此刻的心事；感受词在对应乐句出现，也更容易把听到的音乐和人物感受联系起来。尤其S06、S11—S13，Y保留了想靠近又怕要得太多、自己也需要对方、即使对方不需要仍愿意陪伴等关键心理动机，人物变化更完整，前后因果也更清楚。X确实更容易扫读，但压缩过程中丢失了几处重要的心理层次和情感转折。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dadd83ab-6059-4135-8c78-f45e82faa23e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T155033367679Z", "elapsed_seconds": 116.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:52:29.437943+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "66a7bc006700e720f873853ce703847abde01023dedab93b11832d57242d03d5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at